I am TEHRIM SHAMIM SHAIKH holding UAN 100492834301, 101362543410, 100863851828. i ALREADY MAKE REQEST to transfer PF to present UAN 101362543410, but i am not able to open passbook, showing Error
&quot;Dear member your uan linked mobile is also linked with more than two uan. If those uans are yours then apply for transfer of old uan to present one. Please also update your uan with aadhaar linked mobile. All other online services are already through aadhaar linked mobile otp only. One member should have only one account and previous accounts should be transferred to present one. Passbook has your personal data and this is for security of your own data related to your provident fund&quot;

